It allows defining ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/algebraic-data-type.td")}s in Rocq, including ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/recursive-type.td")}s.

Its name bears resemblance to ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/inductive-definition.td")}.
